alse,"checked":null,"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"防止重放攻击","position":{"start":{"line":28,"column":3,"offset":762},"end":{"line":28,"column":9,"offset":768}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":28,"column":3,"offset":762},"end":{"line":28,"column":9,"offset":768}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":28,"column":1,"offset":760},"end":{"line":28,"column":9,"offset":768}}},{"type":"listItem","spread":false,"checked":null,"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"用户体验的考量","position":{"start":{"line":29,"column":3,"offset":772},"end":{"line":29,"column":10,"offset":779}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":29,"column":3,"offset":772},"end":{"line":29,"column":10,"offset":779}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":29,"column":1,"offset":770},"end":{"line":29,"column":10,"offset":779}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":26,"column":1,"offset":738},"end":{"line":29,"column":10,"offset":779}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"不要害怕尝试和犯错；这是我们在密码学和安全领域学习和成长的方式！","position":{"start":{"line":31,"column":1,"offset":783},"end":{"line":31,"column":33,"offset":815}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":31,"column":1,"offset":783},"end":{"line":31,"column":33,"offset":815}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1,"offset":0},"end":{"line":32,"column":1,"offset":817}}},"raw":"import { ArticleSection } from \"../../../../components/ArticleSection/ArticleSection\";\r\n\r\n# 结论\r\n\r\n恭喜！您已完成 Solana 上的 Secp256r1 课程。现在，您对 Secp256r1 在 Solana 上的工作原理及其在实现现代身份验证方法中的作用有了扎实的理解。\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"您学到了什么\" id=\"what-you-learned\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\n在本课程中，您获得了以下重要知识：\r\n- Secp256r1（NIST P-256）椭圆曲线密码学的基础知识\r\n- Solana 如何通过其预编译实现 Secp256r1 签名验证\r\n- Secp256r1 与现代身份验证方法（如通行密钥）的关系\r\n- 如何在您的程序中实现安全的签名验证\r\n- 使用带有 Secp256r1 公钥的 PDA 的最佳实践\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"下一步\" id=\"next-steps\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\n现在，您已经准备好开始使用 Secp256r1 在 Solana 上构建安全的身份验证系统！以下是一些推荐的下一步：\r\n\r\n1. 尝试在您自己的程序中实现 Secp256r1 签名验证\r\n2. 探索 [挑战部分](/zh-cn/challenges) 以进行实践练习\r\n3. 考虑如何使用 Secp256r1 提高您的应用程序的安全性\r\n4. 加入我们的社区，分享您的实现并获得帮助\r\n\r\n请记住，虽然 Secp256r1 提供了密码学基础，但实现安全的身份验证需要仔细考虑：\r\n- 正确的签名验证\r\n- 安全的密钥管理\r\n- 防止重放攻击\r\n- 用户体验的考量\r\n\r\n不要害怕尝试和犯错；这是我们在密码学和安全领域学习和成长的方式！\r\n","highlightedCode":{}}